# Mission 12 turn-advance SIGSEGV triage probe (G2).
# 40 end-turn cycles adapted from mission_13_turn_survival_route.script;
# run under CLASH95_CAMPAIGN_ROUTE_GDB=1 to capture the turn-advance crash
# backtrace. Objective evidence is NOT expected; this is a diagnostic probe.
